  local_modifications:
      "cwalk.go is patched so that filepath.SkipDir returned for a regular "
      "file skips only that file, each path is processed as its own job with "
      "errors (including broken symlinks) reported per path, and the walk "
      "root is handled like any other path. cwalk_test.go is new and tests "
      "the SkipDir behavior. MIT-LICENSE.txt is renamed to LICENSE, short "
      "copyright/SPDX headers are added to the modified and new Go files, "
